WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.455
Compare the two ideas on screen different roles and

00:00:03.494 --> 00:00:08.889
overlapping contributions An assistant office manager or chief of

00:00:08.955 --> 00:00:12.968
staff may contribute in different ways These are not

00:00:13.034 --> 00:00:15.047
a universal ranking of jobs

00:00:15.927 --> 00:00:21.085
Now compare actual delegation with its specific conditions Technical

00:00:21.098 --> 00:00:24.638
ability and a senior-sounding title do not create permission

00:00:24.651 --> 00:00:27.440
to approve a payment or make a specialist decision

00:00:28.786 --> 00:00:32.207
When a request crosses the actual mandate identify the

00:00:32.272 --> 00:00:37.009
owner who can decide Useful coordination can continue without

00:00:37.101 --> 00:00:39.444
pretending that authority has transferred
